{
  "name": "Instagram-Studio — Fase 2 (Agendado)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fase 2 — Edição por template (gatilho agendado)\n\nA cada 15 min chama `POST /edit` no serviço `instagram-studio`. Ele edita os posts que você aprovou (moveu para `02_aprovados/` com `legenda.txt`), monta o cronograma e devolve o resumo. A edição é idempotente: posts já editados são pulados, só os novos rodam.\n\n**Antes de ativar:**\n1. Serviço no ar com ffmpeg instalado: `STUDIO_TOKEN=... node src/cli.js serve`\n2. No nó HTTP: ajuste a URL e o `x-studio-token`.\n3. No nó Gmail: selecione a credencial e o destinatário.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note1",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [120, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 15 }] }
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "A cada 15 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [140, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:4599/edit",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "x-studio-token", "value": "COLE_SEU_STUDIO_TOKEN" }]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http",
      "name": "studio /edit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [400, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-novos",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.novos }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "iff",
      "name": "Editou algo novo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "voce@exemplo.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.summary }}",
        "options": { "appendAttribution": false }
      },
      "id": "gmail",
      "name": "Gmail: editado & agendado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [920, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "noop",
      "name": "Nada novo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [920, 520]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "A cada 15 min": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "studio /edit", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "studio /edit": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Editou algo novo?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Editou algo novo?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail: editado & agendado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Nada novo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {}
}
